// Coordinates are in metres. X = horizontal, Y = vertical, Z = depth.
// 200 x 100 x 1 cells: 0.5 mm in X/Y; unchanged 1 mm depth.
// Ten connected blocks let us label separate openings and the wafer segment.
// Shared block faces are internal fluid connections, NOT walls.
