(
    hex (0 1 7 6 18 19 25 24) (40 20 1) simpleGrading (1 1 1)
    hex (1 2 8 7 19 20 26 25) (10 20 1) simpleGrading (1 1 1)
    hex (2 3 9 8 20 21 27 26) (20 20 1) simpleGrading (1 1 1)
